# Keep line endings consistent for every checkout. Without this, a Windows
# clone (core.autocrlf=true) writes CRLF while Prettier/EditorConfig expect LF,
# so `npm run lint` reports a CRLF warning on nearly every line of every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be converted.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
